ML components. Abstraction is one way to achieve effort reduction
by creating models of complex systems that hide unnecessary details
to focus only on the required aspects. For example, the goal of P5
and P9 is to use models to reduce complexity when developing ML
solutions for cyber–physical systems. Automation is another way to


