reduce development effort, artifacts such as code, configurations, and
documentation can be generated from the models without any manual
effort. For example, the goal of P10 is to generate dataset description
documents from models with dataset details such as structure, prove-
nance, and social concerns. P28 aims to automatically generate code
for neural networks by transforming MDE models into code. Integration
of ML components into the rest of the system is not a trivial task;
